</element-citation></ref><ref id="CR19"><label>19.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="other">Fabbri M, Beracci A, Martoni M et al. (2021) Measuring subjective sleep quality: a review. Int J Environ Res Public Health. 18(3):1082.</mixed-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>